{"event": "checkpoint", "page_id": "11.17", "unit_index": 0, "unit_sha256": "8799dcc0cb85e184c2832172692a0d5e801e20f057b293f473352ad955ec9f95", "source_sha256": "983d8dfd4cee497955a36068c7a3e7b47c4bee7700136cae4fc244db98e705b5", "figures_sha256": {"course/figures/new-11.17-left-right.svg": "6eca589973e3dd73762d23a5075c637e01c23af150da1525e72f75bbf46daf22", "course/figures/new-11.17-single-object.svg": "f2106ac0b76b2e82e4b0eac6f3544eca8856120fefe19286ec28eb398e00c2a5"}, "understanding": "有限三服灰阶先问类非颜色材质适合度。图单包问名称包，加右短靴问包在哪变左；手绘示意非原图/实生成，两宽本人看。像素→自训入口特征→接头→文字核心同时读问题，特征非老师给类名。关系需物件+所在格，平均仅有包短靴交换不变不够位置。此处仍未CTC，继续当页context顺读，不以19.6实际例回填此手绘成真源。", "materials_and_labels": "两图标题/希望答案与底手绘标签明确。FashionMNIST三个类与19.6范围同，关系图固定格位公开；没有任何包类别标签作为输入捷径。", "expected_change": "交换两格物件，问包在短靴哪侧应右，即使集合类同；单包类别题不变，说明需要保留线索由问题决定。", "confusion_and_quote": "‘留下哪些資訊，要由問題決定’功能/关系明白，原warmup略此页现在本人真补；CTC还未知。", "missing_visuals": "两个必要手绘SVG各640/360真看，图/问题/期望答匹配。", "claims": [], "four_questions": [], "introduced_methods": [], "method_introductions": [], "issues": [], "visual_checks": [{"figure": "course/figures/new-11.17-single-object.svg", "source_sha256": "f2106ac0b76b2e82e4b0eac6f3544eca8856120fefe19286ec28eb398e00c2a5", "details": "640/360tools.view_image。", "observation": "单包手绘，问题图片是什么/希望包，底明确非来源原图。", "status": "verified", "receipt": {"path": "docs/course-revision-20261007-phase7/reviews/artifacts/p7_reader_e/f97087c36fdd44fb8750ac54d6e6d341-11.17-0-f2106ac0b76b.json", "sha256": "b61e369a93afd32a718d913b2f4082245484a4e216d5d9bc5500bd56508ba072"}, "artifacts": [{"path": "outputs/phase7-render/f2106ac0b76b2e82e4b0eac6f3544eca8856120fefe19286ec28eb398e00c2a5/640.png", "sha256": "28900e24a54ad39ce622e2eb6b19e2c0db37d1594988a5b27fd42112b84cab24", "width": 640}, {"path": "outputs/phase7-render/f2106ac0b76b2e82e4b0eac6f3544eca8856120fefe19286ec28eb398e00c2a5/360.png", "sha256": "4ced1e198cc125410195896dd928817a4714064464adbe4bdd23d563ca759e30", "width": 360}]}, {"figure": "course/figures/new-11.17-left-right.svg", "source_sha256": "6eca589973e3dd73762d23a5075c637e01c23af150da1525e72f75bbf46daf22", "details": "640/360tools.view_image。", "observation": "包左短靴右带格位分线，问相对侧/希望左，明确作者手绘非原图。", "status": "verified", "receipt": {"path": "docs/course-revision-20261007-phase7/reviews/artifacts/p7_reader_e/f97087c36fdd44fb8750ac54d6e6d341-11.17-0-6eca589973e3.json", "sha256": "3c4671c0e0bc82299b59dc2a3a21c11c4caf6cb4d5f2ccd5c8724d40c196bdd9"}, "artifacts": [{"path": "outputs/phase7-render/6eca589973e3dd73762d23a5075c637e01c23af150da1525e72f75bbf46daf22/640.png", "sha256": "44dfe24e7414d1e897c1746e729049311b31472c7c5f80bbb2d22af8d27a7276", "width": 640}, {"path": "outputs/phase7-render/6eca589973e3dd73762d23a5075c637e01c23af150da1525e72f75bbf46daf22/360.png", "sha256": "16f323ce0abc577354eb177341be5c57e8b028ef06fb2724c86e9652449694ea", "width": 360}]}], "rechecks": [], "event_index": 1, "recorded_at": "2026-10-06T23:14:54.644705+00:00", "previous_sha256": "fb5fbaefe14d9912d43fa03cbcaea8be3ae508bd8ec6f5f3941a2212758a8641"}
{"event": "checkpoint", "page_id": "11.17", "unit_index": 1, "unit_sha256": "350648cd30655244b4fb1c32e64229e493d3c9cd3408ab1a806e3a9bf2c053b1", "source_sha256": "983d8dfd4cee497955a36068c7a3e7b47c4bee7700136cae4fc244db98e705b5", "figures_sha256": {"course/figures/new-11.17-left-right.svg": "6eca589973e3dd73762d23a5075c637e01c23af150da1525e72f75bbf46daf22", "course/figures/new-11.17-single-object.svg": "f2106ac0b76b2e82e4b0eac6f3544eca8856120fefe19286ec28eb398e00c2a5"}, "understanding": "train可图/问题/短答比较更新，infer仅图/问题，不附包在左答案。两独立控制：对调物件原问变右，原图改问短靴相对包亦右，前测位置后测问题物件顺序；全答左非关系。原商品来源家族裁缩配对同份，测试新原图，文字任务限定字表笔画下一框范围，三任务分评。图全手绘/设计希望答非Fashion原像素或执行，来源28×28灰阶MIT仅说明可设计任务。", "materials_and_labels": "两控制保持一条件改变，问题物件次序与画面位置是两个独立操作。家族定义已本人19.3读，此处新增来源例吻合。官方README/LICENSE未开，当前图无原数据影像。", "expected_change": "原图问短靴在包哪侧右，证明仅缓存全图左句不可兼顾新问；把同包缩放塞test仍泄漏。", "confusion_and_quote": "‘希望答案為人工指定的設計例，不是模型執行結果’来源非常清楚；此页仍无CTC算法，不能借此说懂CTC折叠。", "missing_visuals": "两图必要已看，无新图；原资料/许可外链接未查。", "claims": [], "four_questions": [], "introduced_methods": [], "method_introductions": [], "issues": [], "visual_checks": [], "rechecks": [], "event_index": 2, "recorded_at": "2026-10-06T23:15:14.045053+00:00", "previous_sha256": "cb3f68c3b10757970fe00edcbc808009bf231191ad7ea6fb932a1a64d384dd80"}
{"event": "checkpoint", "page_id": "11.17", "unit_index": 2, "unit_sha256": "7d678ba8885f315ad86e2305505d48791096e2d6ce4ae4d99663ec6eb5e6d9bc", "source_sha256": "983d8dfd4cee497955a36068c7a3e7b47c4bee7700136cae4fc244db98e705b5", "figures_sha256": {"course/figures/new-11.17-left-right.svg": "6eca589973e3dd73762d23a5075c637e01c23af150da1525e72f75bbf46daf22", "course/figures/new-11.17-single-object.svg": "f2106ac0b76b2e82e4b0eac6f3544eca8856120fefe19286ec28eb398e00c2a5"}, "understanding": "当前只回指11.14平均位置丢失和作者来源笔记。11.14我未补读，但本页已完整重给平均摘要不足反例；来源笔记是作者范围/研究记录，本独立阅读不打开。整页有限商品类/关系输入保位置+问题，训练标签与推论无答案，换素材/换问法控制、family隔离都理解。CTC算法未在此提供，仍不会假称已读。", "materials_and_labels": "本页没有code或实际执行，全部图希望答手指定；回指不是我已有trace。", "expected_change": "只说看过作者来源笔记会违反独立reader授权，当前无需那些来理解两控制例；新图或反向问原答不变会失败。", "confusion_and_quote": "‘平均摘要可能丟掉左右資訊’本页自己证明足够；CTC机制后须另说明或标未知，不以跨页专业脑补。", "missing_visuals": "两图两宽真实看，无缺必要材料；实页DOM/原来源未验证。", "claims": [], "four_questions": [{"at": "section_end", "scope": "11.17", "subject": "有限商品与关系任务及控制", "questions": [{"number": 1, "answer": "有限三灰阶类及固定格关系任务，像素特征非预写名称，核心同时读问题。", "claims": [{"claim": "表示非答案名。", "status": "prior", "trace_file": "docs/course-revision-20261007-phase7/reviews/freeze-01/traces/reader/e/f97087c36fdd44fb8750ac54d6e6d341.jsonl", "event_index": 1, "quote": "這些數字不是老師先寫好的物件名稱，而是由可調參數算出來的表示。"}]}, {"number": 2, "answer": "同物件换位置/物件顺序问法需改答案，有限范围让成功有清楚意义。", "claims": [{"claim": "两控制。", "status": "prior", "trace_file": "docs/course-revision-20261007-phase7/reviews/freeze-01/traces/reader/e/f97087c36fdd44fb8750ac54d6e6d341.jsonl", "event_index": 2, "quote": "前一題看是否使用位置，後一題看是否使用問題裡的物件次序。"}]}, {"number": 3, "answer": "train图/问题/标签更新→infer仅图/问题→对调图或问题顺序分别测→新原图且来源家族同份，分类/关系/读字分评。", "claims": [{"claim": "traininfer区别。", "status": "prior", "trace_file": "docs/course-revision-20261007-phase7/reviews/freeze-01/traces/reader/e/f97087c36fdd44fb8750ac54d6e6d341.jsonl", "event_index": 2, "quote": "推論時則只提供圖片與問題。"}]}, {"number": 4, "answer": "两手绘希望答案是设计非模型执行，未原Fashion或作者笔记读，CTC算法仍未本页解释。", "claims": [{"claim": "图证据边界。", "status": "prior", "trace_file": "docs/course-revision-20261007-phase7/reviews/freeze-01/traces/reader/e/f97087c36fdd44fb8750ac54d6e6d341.jsonl", "event_index": 2, "quote": "希望答案為人工指定的設計例，不是模型執行結果。"}]}]}], "introduced_methods": [], "method_introductions": [], "issues": [], "visual_checks": [], "rechecks": [], "event_index": 3, "recorded_at": "2026-10-06T23:15:29.726332+00:00", "previous_sha256": "bdaa09d07ed929b1464fce09f0902d0c18d83e19def8753d54642ad4c102248b"}
